  "text_input": "Patient was apparently normal 5 days back when he developed involuntary movements of bilateral upper and lower limbs.\nOn Tuesday (07/04/26) at 6:30 PM, he had Stiffening of limbs,Tongue rolling,Tongue biting,Frothing from mouth.Episode lasted for ~5 minutes and was associated with loss of consciousness.No history of Post-ictal confusion,Up-rolling of eyes,Incontinence of urine,Aura.Also c/o yellowish discoloration of eyes for 5 days, sudden in onset and progressive in nature.\nC/o dark yellowish discoloration of urine for 1 month, insidious in onset and progressive in nature.C/o jaundice,C/o loss of appetite for 1 month (insidious onset, progressive),C/o weight loss for 3 months (~5 kg), progressiveNo complaints of Decreased urine output,Puffiness of face,Abdominal distension,Vomiting,Hematemesis",
